# jta-module ships only the default auto-select wrapper here, at the
# lowest priority. Consumers force a specific JTA implementation by
# shipping their own META-INF/services file that names one of the
# detail impls (GeronimoTransactionManagerProvider,
# AtomikosTransactionManagerProvider, NarayanaTransactionManagerProvider)
# -- the detail impls carry a lower numeric @Priority than the wrapper
# so they win whenever they are explicitly registered.
org.os890.jawelte.module.jta.impl.adapter.provider.AutoSelectTransactionManagerProvider
